flowchart LR
  req[Request] --> vercel[vercel.json headers]
  vercel --> csp[CSP: self + named CDNs, no inline scripts]
  vercel --> sri[SRI on every CDN file]
  vercel --> frame[X-Frame-Options DENY, frame-ancestors none]
  vercel --> other[HSTS, nosniff, referrer, permissions]
  vercel --> robots[noindex on admin and API]
  vercel --> cache[asset and locale caching]
